<title>DENMARK: Danish Sophus buys Swedish, Dutch firms.</title>
<headline>Danish Sophus buys Swedish, Dutch firms.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish services group Sophus Berendensen said on Tuesday that its textile service division had bought Sweden's Norbottens Lans laundry and Dutch linen supply firm Ster Super Service.</p>
<p>It gave no price for the purchases but said the two acquisitions had combined annual turnover of 63 million Danish crowns.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
